Subject: [PATCH] test: Isolate Ctrl+C state and await PowerShell resumption

Re-execute the ConPTY interrupt fixture alone before enabling its inherited Ctrl+C disposition. Wait for the complete returning prompt before sending ver, sharing the original resumption deadline and retaining the exit assertion.
